0 changes5~
Apr 14, 2013 - grimy/light green now spawn in a chest to avoid overkill.
Apr 14, 2013 - drink command now works while out of war.
Sep 22, 2013 - Attempting to lock doors that are already locked delays player.
Sep 22, 2013 - Players ability to pick locks increases with war duration.
Sep 22, 2013 - In-war players can set noplay to prevent war extensions.
~

0 changes4~
Sep 21, 1999 - Equipment on players is not destroyed at reset.
Sep 21, 1999 - FFA command added.  Allows you to join the FFA war.
Sep 23, 1999 - Private wars mostly installed.
Sep 25, 1999 - Subwar channel added.  Equipment points installed.
Sep 25, 1999 - Smoke bombs modified.  Identify spell removed.  Use command.
Sep 25, 1999 - Installed Wyrd's area.  (Ocean).  It's somewhere in Jawan.
Sep 27, 1999 - Coinflip function added.  ('cause I didn't have a coin in RL.)
Aug 24, 2000 - Teleport tweaked, mob blinds reduced, war length upped 2 ticks.
Mar  8, 2001 - Doom prevention code added.  War lengthened if no one waiting.
Mar  8, 2001 - Teleport command and spell restricted in private war.
Mar  8, 2001 - Early war teleport shouldn't hit closed zones anymore.
Jul  3, 2001 - Added 'last' command to show recent logins.
Aug  6, 2002 - Added 'skill balance', 'skill bash', and 'skill sixth sense'
Aug  6, 2002 -  affects for use on items.
Oct  7, 2002 - Healthlag war flag added.  Healthlag and Noregen war flags
Oct  7, 2002 -  may be automatically activated on war extensions.
Oct 10, 2002 - Magic Missile tweaked for Invoker class - casts multiple
Oct 10, 2002 -  missiles per cast.  Added 'skill backstab' affect.
Nov 24, 2012 - Replaced ancient SillyMUD tracking code with faster custom
Nov 24, 2012 -  tracking.  No more mallocs causing ridiculous lag.
Nov 25, 2012 - PKmud now broadcasts some events to Twitter, player logins,
Nov 25, 2012 -  war wins.  Follow @PKMudAnnounce
Nov 25, 2012 - Swim skill added.  3 second delay for failing.
Dec  2, 2012 - Waldo added.  Teleports when you find him.  In-war get potion.
Dec  2, 2012 - Rambo, hunters, etc., are also teleported outside of wars now.
Jan 19, 2013 - Players are always matched before NPCs in rooms.
Feb  1, 2013 - 20% chance for war extensions to disable on extension.
Feb 24, 2013 - Whichway command now available to mortals.
Mar     2013 - Phasing added.  Dead players can now fight NPCs while waiting.
Apr 06, 2013 - Logan NPC added to practice chasing.  Runs away while hurt.
~

