0 changes_old~

Oct 10, 1996 - randomclass cmd toggles setting your class at random
  for each war.

- 06/07/96 - Updates.
		Fixed funky AC in continuous war. Non-continuous war equip
		doesn't get destroyed. Getting teleported to rooms with no
		exits fixed. You can quit during continuous war if your
		not being hunted. Monks not getting canoes or their correct
		AC when joining fixed. Invetory items were not flagged as
		inventory items, fixed that, and they don't get destroyed
