		Spells: smoke bomb, psionic blast, ego whip, confusion.
		Barbarians get movement delay, barbarians don't get restored
		for kills. Continuous wars have been added. Item HP is added
		and items can be destroyed. Doomsday countdown depends on 
		number of players in war. Terminator bugs fixed. Various
		crash bugs fixed. (Mostly all from my new code) Ansi has been
		added.

Anything you don't understand there is probably a help file on it.

